# A transformer: two coils facing each other across two bars (an iron core), each coil with a lead top and bottom.
# Pins 1, 2 the left coil top and bottom; 3, 4 the right coil top and bottom.
kind transformer
convention A transformer: two coils facing each other across a core of two bars.
pin 1 -100 -70
pin 2 -100 70
pin 3 100 -70
pin 4 100 70
line -100 -70 -40 -70 -40 -60
line -100 70 -40 70 -40 60
line 100 -70 40 -70 40 -60
line 100 70 40 70 40 60
arc -40 -45.0 15.0 -90 180
arc -40 -15.0 15.0 -90 180
arc -40 15.0 15.0 -90 180
arc -40 45.0 15.0 -90 180
arc 40 -45.0 15.0 -90 -180
arc 40 -15.0 15.0 -90 -180
arc 40 15.0 15.0 -90 -180
arc 40 45.0 15.0 -90 -180
line -6 -70 -6 70
line 6 -70 6 70
